 "style": "high-energy modern sing-along pop for families, 122 bpm, bright major key, punchy drums and big handclaps, bouncy synth bass, ukulele and glockenspiel hooks, warm friendly male lead vocal with a cheerful group chorus on every chorus, call-and-response, verses light and bouncy, pre-chorus builds with a rising snare roll, chorus explodes with full band and group vocals, short claps-and-stomps breakdown, final chorus modulates up a whole step with the biggest energy, vocals start right away on the first beat with the chorus, no instrumental intro, short punchy ending",
 "lyrics": "[Chorus - full band, group vocals]\nHow do animals sleep at night?\nSome lie down and some stand upright!\nClose your eyes and count to three,\nSleepy zoo friends, just like me!\n\n[Verse 1 - light and bouncy]\nThe lion sleeps most of the day,\nNapping lots, then up to play!\nThe giraffe takes tiny naps,\nStanding up, just short ones, perhaps!\n\n[Pre-Chorus - build up, rising drums]\nYawn and stretch and rub your eyes,\nSleepy zoo friends, what a surprise!\n\n[Chorus - full band, group vocals]\nHow do animals sleep at night?\nSome lie down and some stand upright!\nClose your eyes and count to three,\nSleepy zoo friends, just like me!\n\n[Verse 2 - light and bouncy]\nThe zebra can sleep standing tall,\nReady to run if friends should call!\nThe hippo naps in water deep,\nFloating up to breathe in sleep!\n\n[Bridge - claps and stomps, call and response]\nStand up tall and close your eyes,\nLike a zebra, what a surprise!\nCurl up small like a cozy cat,\nYawn, yawn, yawn, imagine that!\n\n[Verse 3 - light and bouncy]\nThe elephant can stand or lie,\nUnder the big savanna sky!\nMilo sleeps up in his tree,\nTucked in his nest, sleepy as can be!\n\n[Pre-Chorus - build up, rising drums]\nYawn and stretch and rub your eyes,\nSleepy zoo friends, what a surprise!\n\n[Final Chorus - key change up, biggest energy, everyone sings]\nHow do animals sleep at night?\nSome lie down and some stand upright!\nClose your eyes and count to three,\nSleepy zoo friends, just like me!\n\n[Outro - quick and happy]\nGoodnight, zoo friends! Bye-bye, friends!",
